# Getting Started with PDFKit

### Installation

Installation uses the [npm](http://npmjs.org/) package manager. Just type the
following command after installing npm.

    npm install pdfkit

### Creating a document

Creating a PDFKit document is quite simple. Require the named `PDFDocument`
export and create an instance of the class.

    const { PDFDocument } = require('pdfkit');
    const doc = new PDFDocument();

Or, from an ES module:

    import { PDFDocument } from 'pdfkit';
    const doc = new PDFDocument();
